 is not very strong, just kill it. Be careful though, as two <a href=\"#/wiki/Elf%20Scout\">Elf Scouts</a> might spawn after killing it to avenge its death.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 1,587 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><i>Empty</i></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.52</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"52.173913\" style=\"text-align:center;\">52%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Deer%20Skin\"><img alt=\"White Deer Skin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/White_Deer_Skin_931fd7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Deer%20Skin\">White Deer Skin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.20</td>\n<td class=\"loot-uncommon\" data-sort-value=\"19.974795\" style=\"text-align:center;\">20.0%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Deer%20Antlers\"><img alt=\"White Deer Antlers\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/White_Deer_Antlers_1eda6b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Deer%20Antlers\">White Deer Antlers</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.20</td>\n<td 